  "question": "Do SCP Allow statements honor a Resource ARN and NotAction? AWS's SCP syntax page says SCP Allows may only use \"Resource\": \"*\", while its September 2025 announcement says SCPs support the full IAM policy language, which the analyzer follows (review open question 2). The simulator's User Guide page says it evaluates \"resource scoping in deny statements\", so a difference here may be a simulator limit.",
